ATM System – Python Project
📌 Overview

This project is a simple ATM (Automated Teller Machine) simulator written in Python.
It allows users to log in with a card number and PIN, and perform basic banking operations such as:

Check Balance

Withdraw Money

Deposit Money

View Mini Statement

Change PIN

Logout

This is a console-based project suitable for beginner to intermediate Python learners or college school projects.

🧠 Features
✔ User Authentication

Login using card number + secure PIN

3 attempts before card is blocked

✔ Balance Inquiry

View available bank balance

✔ Cash Withdrawal

Withdraw any amount (with balance validation)

✔ Cash Deposit

Deposit any amount easily

✔ Mini Statement

Shows last 5 transactions

✔ Change PIN

Securely update PIN

✔ Object-Oriented Programming

Uses classes: ATM, Account

Clean and modular code

